def specialFilter(nums):
    def is_valid(num):
        """Check if a number is both greater than 10 and has first and last digits as odd."""
        return num > 10 and (num % 10 in [1, 3, 5, 7, 9]) and (num % 10 != 0)

    return sum(1 for num in nums if is_valid(num))
```

