        next_number = fib_numbers[-1] + fib_numbers[-2]
        if next_number > n:
            break
        elif next_number in fib_numbers:
            break
        fib_numbers.append(next_number)
    if fib_numbers[-1] > n:
        return fib_numbers[-1]
    else:
        return fib_numbers[-2]
```

